    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have spent extra time studying how firearms and the infinite energy of the void go so well together!</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Etherslinger talent class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain one additional etherslinger talent. You must meet all of the prerequisites for this etherslinger talent.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Extra Etherslinger Talent an additional time for every five etherslinger levels you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagic-feats#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
